  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9TYytCO.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kc2YGgk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/554379889122213888.svg?label=Join us on Discord&logo=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&style=flat-square\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Additions 是 Mekanism 的官方附属模组，为游戏增添了更多杂项功能。这些功能中的大多数在 1.12 及更早版本的主模组中就存在，但后来都迁移到了本模组中。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">功能：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">幼年生物：</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 苦力怕</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 末影人</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 骷髅</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 流浪者</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 凋灵骷髅</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">黑曜石 TNT</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">发光面板</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">气球</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">多种形状的塑料方块变体</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">语音服务器</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">其他 Mekanism 模块链接：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-generators\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Generators</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Tools</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>文档</strong>&nbsp;可在 Mekanism 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwiki.aidancbrady.com%252fwiki%252fMain_Page\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方维基</a> 上查阅，该维基由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.indiewikis.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">IndieWikis</a> 提供托管！内容仍在不断完善中，如果您有能力，恳请贡献您的力量！</p>\n<p><strong>源代码&nbsp;</strong>已在 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/mekanism-mod/Mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></strong> 上公开！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>支持团队&nbsp;</strong>可通过 Patreon：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=260704\" rel=\"nofollow\">aidancbrady</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/pupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>支持团队&nbsp;</strong>可通过 Ko-fi：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
